  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Make ur treee cutting easier</Major>
    <Description>Okay, are you tired of starting the chainsaw through the inventory? I made a helper for anyone who wants it. The chainsaw needs to be in Slot 2, otherwise it won’t work. You can bind it to any key. The chainsaw will try to start once with this — if it doesn’t work, just press the button again.
Resolution 1080p,DPI 1600 ingame first person sens 12,same in 3rd person mouse sens  </Description>
